<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76778" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάλαισ-μα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bout</i> or <i>fall in wrestling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ ἓν π. ἔδραμε νικᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.33
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἓν μὲν τόδ᾽ ἤδη τῶν τριῶν π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					589
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				256b
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>feats of wrestling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				9.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>P.</u>
				8.35
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>CR</u>
				43.210
			</span></i> (Asia Minor). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>struggle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				63
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				776
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				880
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1214
			</span></i>; of war, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.66c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαίσμαθ᾽ ἡμῶν ὁ βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					550
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>trick, 'chip' in wrestling</i>, metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				689
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				878
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δικαστηρίου</span>
			<i>a trick</i> of the courts, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.205
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σόφισμα . . καὶ π. τῶν ἀκουόντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					8.12
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ Θετταλὸν π.</span>, addressed
			to a person, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.308b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in pl., of
			works of art, <i>groups of wrestlers</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				2.32
			</span></i>.</div>
